019289,-0.05262044,0.07430237,0.06984581,0.03769819,0.01362789,-0.02277333,0.09109355,-0.05275702,0.05481031,-0.10726284,-0.06773202,-0.0049984,0.18457982,0.00570735,0.01027643,0.03854066,-0.03317438,-0.00497245,-0.03086043,0.01227134,0.04344391,-0.01500773,0.09422002,-0.08236286,0.03545314,0.043027,-0.03827807,0.03354368,0.05486075,-0.00602353,-0.00022675,0.01867377,0.07769128,0.04422484,0.07932754,0.02292793,-0.02886415,-0.03882944,-0.04782742,0.01313178,-0.03865258,0.00799912,0.01467962,-0.02636641,0.05631696,0.05101541,-0.03201064,-0.00519514,-0.02750276,-0.00820814,-0.03121154,0.01217715,0.07311618,0.11146395,0.02736663],"last_embed":{"tokens":469,"hash":"1et2o8f"}}},"last_read":{"hash":"1et2o8f","at":1781137144379},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1781018307780,"size":15130,"at":1781137139664,"hash":"1et2o8f"},"blocks":{"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)":[1,187],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#{1}":[3,17],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)":[18,110],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C1 — The tier-coupled arrival (EXPRESS-late / DEFERRED-early) is *engineered to produce the result*, asserted not sourced, and possibly reversed in reality. **[BLOCKING]** (Soundness #3, Falsifiability B1, Realism B1)":[20,34],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C1 — The tier-coupled arrival (EXPRESS-late / DEFERRED-early) is *engineered to produce the result*, asserted not sourced, and possibly reversed in reality. **[BLOCKING]** (Soundness #3, Falsifiability B1, Realism B1)#{1}":[21,34],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C2 — No pre-registered null and no required negative-control cell → the test cannot demonstrably fail. **[BLOCKING]** (Falsifiability B1, Soundness #1)":[35,45],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C2 — No pre-registered null and no required negative-control cell → the test cannot demonstrably fail. **[BLOCKING]** (Falsifiability B1, Soundness #1)#{1}":[36,45],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C3 — \"M₀ incremental-greedy\" is under-specified; two non-equivalent readings, one of which collapses M₀→M₁, and the MILP has no primitive to express the intended one. **[BLOCKING]** (Mechanism B1, Soundness #2)":[46,59],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C3 — \"M₀ incremental-greedy\" is under-specified; two non-equivalent readings, one of which collapses M₀→M₁, and the MILP has no primitive to express the intended one. **[BLOCKING]** (Mechanism B1, Soundness #2)#{1}":[47,59],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C4 — L2 can be dominated by fallback-avoidance and avoided-tardiness-penalty, not reshuffle — i.e. the *wrong* thesis. **[BLOCKING]** (Falsifiability B3, Mechanism M6, Realism m3)":[60,72],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C4 — L2 can be dominated by fallback-avoidance and avoided-tardiness-penalty, not reshuffle — i.e. the *wrong* thesis. **[BLOCKING]** (Falsifiability B3, Mechanism M6, Realism m3)#{1}":[61,72],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C5 — The DEFERRED-bump is the value mechanism, but (a) the ledger can't enforce the cross-arc atomic move, and (b) the bump is treated as costless. **[BLOCKING mechanism + MATERIAL realism]** (Mechanism B2, Realism M2)":[73,85],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C5 — The DEFERRED-bump is the value mechanism, but (a) the ledger can't enforce the cross-arc atomic move, and (b) the bump is treated as costless. **[BLOCKING mechanism + MATERIAL realism]** (Mechanism B2, Realism M2)#{1}":[74,85],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C6 — Time-scalar inconsistency: graph-build forward-propagation, the MILP's `arr_dest` scalar, and the scorer's running-clock walk must share ONE scalar table — else OTP is contaminated and the regret floor breaks (`Reg<0`). **[BLOCKING]** (Mechanism B3, Mechanism M5)":[86,99],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C6 — Time-scalar inconsistency: graph-build forward-propagation, the MILP's `arr_dest` scalar, and the scorer's running-clock walk must share ONE scalar table — else OTP is contaminated and the regret floor breaks (`Reg<0`). **[BLOCKING]** (Mechanism B3, Mechanism M5)#{1}":[87,99],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C7 — The H₀ human baseline is stated as batch-at-cutoff but implemented/penalized as on-arrival → a strawman that inflates L1/L2; compounds with C1. **[MATERIAL]** (Realism M3, Falsifiability M4)":[100,110],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C7 — The H₀ human baseline is stated as batch-at-cutoff but implemented/penalized as on-arrival → a strawman that inflates L1/L2; compounds with C1. **[MATERIAL]** (Realism M3, Falsifiability M4)#{1}":[101,110],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings":[111,144],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{1}":[113,113],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{2}":[114,116],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{3}":[117,117],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{4}":[118,120],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{5}":[121,121],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{6}":[122,123],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{7}":[124,124],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{8}":[125,127],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{9}":[128,128],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{10}":[129,130],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{11}":[131,131],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{12}":[132,133],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{13}":[134,134],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{14}":[135,136],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{15}":[137,137],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{16}":[138,139],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{17}":[140,140],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#B. Single-agent material findings#{18}":[141,144],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats":[145,162],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{1}":[147,147],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{2}":[148,148],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{3}":[149,149],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{4}":[150,150],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{5}":[151,151],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{6}":[152,152],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{7}":[153,153],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{8}":[154,154],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{9}":[155,155],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{10}":[156,157],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{11}":[158,158],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#C. Minor / scope caveats#{12}":[159,162],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#D. What's sound (4-agent consensus — do not churn)":[163,173],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#D. What's sound (4-agent consensus — do not churn)#{1}":[165,173],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#E. Recommended disposition (for user triage)":[174,187],"#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#E. Recommended disposition (for user triage)#{1}":[176,187]},"outlinks":[],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"01-Projects/ai-freight-agent/docs/critique/11-simulation-design-review.md"},
