"smart_blocks:01-Projects/ai-freight-agent/docs/critique/11-simulation-design-review.md#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C6 — Time-scalar inconsistency: graph-build forward-propagation, the MILP's `arr_dest` scalar, and the scorer's running-clock walk must share ONE scalar table — else OTP is contaminated and the regret floor breaks (`Reg<0`). **[BLOCKING]** (Mechanism B3, Mechanism M5)": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1u4cvtm","at":1781137139633},"key":"01-Projects/ai-freight-agent/docs/critique/11-simulation-design-review.md#Critique 11 — Simulation Design Review (4-agent, pre-2c-build)#A. Convergent load-bearing findings (≥2 agents)#C6 — Time-scalar inconsistency: graph-build forward-propagation, the MILP's `arr_dest` scalar, and the scorer's running-clock walk must share ONE scalar table — else OTP is contaminated and the regret floor breaks (`Reg<0`). **[BLOCKING]** (Mechanism B3, Mechanism M5)","lines":[86,99],"size":1392,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
